This product, rest-api-with-apikit-java, is a Spring Boot conversion of the
MuleSoft example rest-api-with-apikit. The files under
src/main/resources/apikit-console/ are the console/ directory of
org.mule.modules:mule-module-apikit:3.8.0 (the APIkit 3.8.0 console, developed
by MuleSoft, Inc.), obtained from the MuleSoft releases repository
https://repository.mulesoft.org/releases/
(org/mule/modules/mule-module-apikit/3.8.0/mule-module-apikit-3.8.0.jar) and
copied unchanged. That jar contains no licence file, so it is named here as the
source of those files. The licence and copyright headers embedded in the copied
console scripts and stylesheets, including those of the third-party libraries
bundled in scripts/api-console-vendor.js and of the fonts referenced by
styles/api-console-light-theme.css, are retained unchanged in those files.
